  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "\\(50\\times0.8=40\\).\n\nAlternative method 1: Find one tenth first\n\nEight tenths means taking 8 of 10 equal shares of the original price. One share costs \\(50\\div10=5\\) yuan, so 8 shares cost \\(5\\times8=40\\) yuan. The discounted price is 40 yuan.",
